<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">date: 2024-02-03</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">author: "Your Name"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">tags: ["announcement", "first-post"]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">categories: [</span><span style="color:#032F62;text-decoration:underline">"News"</span><span style="color:#24292E">]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">excerpt: "Welcome to my blog! This is my first post using MarkoPress."</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">---</span></span>
