<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">## Why I Started Blogging</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">I decided to start a blog to:</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Share my knowledge</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Connect with others</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Build an online presence</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Improve my writing</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">## What to Expect</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">I'll be writing about:</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Web development</span></span>
