<h2 id="step-5%3A-rss-feed" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#step-5%3A-rss-feed">#</a> Step 5: RSS Feed</h2>
<p>MarkoPress automatically generates RSS feeds.</p>
<h3 id="feed-location" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#feed-location">#</a> Feed Location</h3>
<p>Your RSS feed is available at:</p>
<pre><code>/api/rss/xml
</code></pre>
<h3 id="subscribe-in-feed-reader" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#subscribe-in-feed-reader">#</a> Subscribe in Feed Reader</h3>
<p>Users can subscribe with:</p>
<ul>
<li>Feedly</li>
<li>NewsBlur</li>
<li>Inoreader</li>
<li>Any RSS reader</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="customize-feed" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#customize-feed">#</a> Customize Feed</h3>
<p>Edit your config to customize the feed:</p>
