<h2 id="advanced-features" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#advanced-features">#</a> Advanced Features</h2>
<h3 id="draft-posts" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#draft-posts">#</a> Draft Posts</h3>
<p>Create posts that won’t be published:</p>
<pre><code class="language-yaml">---
title: &quot;Draft Post&quot;
draft: true
---
</code></pre>
<h3 id="scheduled-posts" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#scheduled-posts">#</a> Scheduled Posts</h3>
<p>Set future dates to schedule posts:</p>
<pre><code class="language-yaml">---
title: &quot;Future Post&quot;
date: 2024-12-25
---
</code></pre>
<h3 id="post-expiration" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#post-expiration">#</a> Post Expiration</h3>
<p>Add expiration dates:</p>
<pre><code class="language-yaml">---
title: &quot;Temporary Announcement&quot;
expires: 2024-03-01
---
</code></pre>
