<h2 id="troubleshooting" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#troubleshooting">#</a> Troubleshooting</h2>
<h3 id="posts-not-showing" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#posts-not-showing">#</a> Posts Not Showing</h3>
<ol>
<li>Check file is in <code>content/blog/</code></li>
<li>Verify frontmatter is valid</li>
<li>Ensure <code>draft: false</code> or no <code>draft</code> field</li>
<li>Run <code>npm run build</code> and check for errors</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="rss-feed-empty" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#rss-feed-empty">#</a> RSS Feed Empty</h3>
<ol>
<li>Ensure blog plugin is enabled</li>
<li>Check posts have valid dates</li>
<li>Verify feed URL: <code>/api/rss/xml</code></li>
</ol>
<h3 id="tags-not-working" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#tags-not-working">#</a> Tags Not Working</h3>
<ol>
<li>Check tag names in frontmatter</li>
<li>Ensure tags are arrays: <code>[&quot;tag1&quot;, &quot;tag2&quot;]</code></li>
<li>Rebuild the site</li>
</ol>
